From 605badcc80b273553a36cfe6ceb1458531736941 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:26:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP Tier 1: splats as memory broadcasts of 4- and 8-byte
 literals (#2744 step 3)

---
